<title>GERMANY: PreussenElektra reports record 96 profits.</title>
<headline>PreussenElektra reports record 96 profits.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   1,860   up 800</p>
<p>    Group sales				  15,400  vs 15,850</p>
<p>Electricity production</p>
<p>    (millions of kilowatt hours)	   105,300 vs 98,500</p>
<p>Gas production</p>
<p>    (millions of kilowatt hours)	   34,000  vs 28,500</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German utility group is PreussenElektra AG, a unit of the German diversified utility group Veba AG.</p>
</text>
